OL,3,AMan charged with GP's murder
OL,4,
OL,5,FA man has been charged with the murder
OL,6,Fof a GP who was found dead at her home.
OL,8,FThe man was arrested after the body of
OL,9,F45-year-old Dr Hannah Terry, also known
OL,10,Fas Hannah Cain, was found at a property
OL,11,Fin Fern Hill, Dersingham, Norfolk, on
OL,12,FSunday.
OL,14,FNorfolk Police said 45-year old Mark
OL,15,FCain, of Fern Hill, Dersingham, has
OL,16,Fbeen charged with her murder.
OL,18,FHe was been remanded in custody ahead
OL,19,Fof an appearance at Norwich
OL,20,FMagistrates' Court on Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
